  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information in a few ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you fill out a form, request a free roof inspection, call or text us, or use our chat widget, we collect the details you provide — typically your name, phone number, email address, property address, and anything you tell us about your roof or project.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit our website, we may collect technical information such as your IP address, browser type, device information, pages viewed, and how you arrived at our site, through cookies and similar technologies (see "Cookies and analytics" below).
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not ask for or need sensitive information such as Social Security numbers or payment card numbers through this website.</p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to your inquiries and requests</li>
    <li>Schedule and perform roof inspections and related services</li>
    <li>Communicate with you about your project, appointment, or claim status</li>
    <li>Send marketing or promotional messages, only if you have opted in to receive them</li>
    <li>Improve our website and understand how visitors use it</li>
    <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Text messaging (SMS)</h2>
  <p>If you provide your mobile number and agree to receive text messages from us, the following terms apply to our text messaging program:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Types of messages.</strong> With your consent, we may send transactional messages (such as appointment confirmations, inspection scheduling, and project or claim-status updates) and, if you separately opt in, marketing messages (such as promotions and seasonal reminders). Consenting to one type is not required to consent to the other, and neither is a condition of purchasing any goods or services.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Message frequency.</strong> Message frequency varies based on your interactions with us.</li>
    <li><strong>Rates.</strong> Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier and plan.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Opting out.</strong> You can cancel at any time by replying STOP to any text message. After you send STOP, we will send one confirmation message and then stop sending texts unless you opt in again.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Help.</strong> For help, reply HELP to any message or call us at 208.996.8748.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>No sale or sharing of opt-in data.</strong> We do not sell or share your mobile number, SMS opt-in, or consent with third parties or affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes. Text-messaging originator opt-in data is not shared with any third parties for such purposes.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your preferences, keep the site secure, and understand how visitors use the site. We may use third-party analytics services (such as Google Analytics) that set their own cookies and collect usage data on our behalf. Most browsers let you refuse or delete cookies through their settings; some site features may not work properly if you do.</p>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only in these limited situations:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Service providers.</strong> We use trusted third-party providers to run our business — for example, our customer-relationship and communications platform, our website host, and our analytics provider. They may access your information only to perform services for us and are expected to protect it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Legal compliance and safety.</strong> We may disclose information when required by law — such as in response to a court order, subpoena, or law-enforcement request — or when reasonably necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of Sawtooth Roofing, our customers, or others.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not share your information with third parties for their own marketing purposes.</p>

  <h2>How we protect your information</h2>
  <p>We take commercially reasonable measures to keep your information secure and limit access to it. No method of transmitting or storing information is completely secure, however, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. You share information with us at your own risk.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Marketing opt-out.</strong> You can opt out of marketing emails using the unsubscribe link in any message, or opt out of marketing texts by replying STOP.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Access, correction, and deletion.</strong> You can ask us to review, update, or delete the personal information we hold about you by contacting us at 208.996.8748 or through our contact page. Because of backups and recordkeeping, some residual information may remain after deletion.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Our website and services are intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>Our website may contain links to other websites we do not control. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites, and we encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will post the updated version on this website and revise the "Last updated" date above.</p>

